51 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2026 so far, March to April sat at 67% and April to May at 72% on the middle of the grids. Grid 19692 had its driest year in 2007 at 67%, and grid 19694 bottomed out in 1988 at 68%.</p>"}
